  "instructions": [
    "Slice the beef into thin strips and season with soy sauce, sake, and mirin.",
    "Heat the vegetable oil in an air fryer to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Air-fry the beef for 5 minutes, or until cooked to desired level of doneness.",
    "In a large bowl, combine the cooked beef, shredded Mexican cheese, sliced onion, and chopped green onion.",
    "Stir-fry the mixture over medium heat until the cheese is melted and the onion is caramelized.",
    "Serve the beef and cheese mixture over a bed of cooked Japanese rice.",
    "Sprinkle sesame seeds over the top of the dish.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
